{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sDd0ZeHtPF1793318812.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>鞍鋼股份截至九月底止第三季度虧損按年擴大超過1.2倍。</p><p></p><p>蝕19.87億元人民幣。扣除非經常性損益虧損，接近20億元人民幣，蝕多1.1倍。期內收入跌百分之2，超過239億元人民幣。集團解釋虧損及收入減少，主要由於今年鋼鐵行業供大於求，處於弱周期、低景氣度運行，鋼材售價持續低迷，但煉焦煤、噴吹煤等原燃料價格，則持續上漲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:00:58.494235+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.398194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:58:17.975577+00:00","content_hash":"567614876abfda56365c0f820b4f562ab28675232196d868264dcfb61f591a42","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:00:58.494235+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}